      "message": "[warning] Line 329: 🟡 `bottomSafeAreaInset` starts at `0`, so the new condition applies bottom padding on first render even on devices with a non-zero inset, then removes it after `onAppear` updates state. This can cause a visible one-frame layout jump. Compute bottom inset synchronously from geometry in the same layout pass (e.g., derive padding directly from `GeometryReader`/safe-area-aware container) or gate with an optional/initialized flag so padding is not decided from a placeholder value.",
